  {
    "_key": "cf6de7c7afb1",
    "_type": "faqBlock",
    "faq": {
      "_type": "accordionBlock",
      "items": [
        {
          "_key": "07ed69ca8ade",
          "answer": [
            {
              "_key": "486387a4c82a",
              "_type": "block",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_key": "ab555132fb45",
                  "_type": "span",
                  "marks": [],
                  "text": "No honest specialist can guarantee a specific Google position. What I can confidently guarantee is a structured approach, complete responsibility, and consistent, disciplined execution. Your project isn’t passed between account managers—one person stays responsible and in context."
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": [],
              "style": "normal"
            }
          ],
          "question": "Can you guarantee results in SEO?"
        },
        {
          "_key": "db0545041e01",
          "answer": [
            {
              "_key": "8eff294b4a5d",
              "_type": "block",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_key": "3f55b42a86cd",
                  "_type": "span",
                  "marks": [],
                  "text": "In many agencies, one specialist can run 10–20 projects. That often means your website gets a few days of attention per month. I personally handle the project end-to-end, stay in the details, and move faster because there’s no internal handoff or “ask someone else”."
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": [],
              "style": "normal"
            }
          ],
          "question": "How is this different from an agency?"
        },
        {
          "_key": "a6a1a7128545",
          "answer": [
            {
              "_key": "50b8c5a111ba",
              "_type": "block",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_key": "3afb70f9a9c9",
                  "_type": "span",
                  "marks": [],
                  "text": "Yes—but it works best as part of a broader SEO system (site structure, location pages, content, and trust signals), not as an isolated task."
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": [],
              "style": "normal"
            }
          ],
          "question": "Is local SEO important for real estate in Cyprus?"
        },
        {
          "_key": "ef2301ae1e2e",
          "answer": [
            {
              "_key": "68557dfdbad9",
              "_type": "block",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_key": "e2106faa946d",
                  "_type": "span",
                  "marks": [],
                  "text": "Typically, early improvements appear within a few months, and stronger growth builds over time. The exact speed depends on competition, site condition, and how much can be implemented."
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": [],
              "style": "normal"
            }
          ],
          "question": "How long does SEO take to show results?"
        },
        {
          "_key": "4b3a817ec727",
          "answer": [
            {
              "_key": "1d96d5ca4b0f",
              "_type": "block",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_key": "60536ca60299",
                  "_type": "span",
                  "marks": [],
                  "text": "Yes. I work with real estate agencies (companies selling listings) and property developers (companies marketing projects and locations).\nThe SEO strategy is adapted depending on the business model, search intent, and how buyers discover and evaluate properties online."
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": [],
              "style": "normal"
            }
          ],
          "question": "Do you work with real estate agencies and property developers?"
        },
        {
          "_key": "22260917457c",
          "answer": [
            {
              "_key": "ae531b4807da",
              "_type": "block",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_key": "9a9280026240",
                  "_type": "span",
                  "marks": [],
                  "text": "Yes. Volumes may be smaller than Google today, but the intent is often clearer. Buyers use AI to shortlist options and compare providers. A properly organized and authoritative website stands a much better chance of being cited and recommended."
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": [],
              "style": "normal"
            }
          ],
          "question": "Do AI tools like ChatGPT, Perplexity, and Copilot bring leads?"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
